Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:54.07,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs35\t(0,3033,\fs30)\c&HA3A7AF&\fad(0,1643)\blur1\t(3033,3033,\c&H787A7D&)\frz271.108\move(1102,424,1025,357,30,3033)}Osu Elementary School Entrance Ceremony{多須 = tasu or osu, it has multiple readings for the kanji 多, but I have decided on Osu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:04.00,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Done?{Are you done yet?}{She says "ii",looks dumb for a whole sentence for that one word.-AE}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:11.24,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,It's not clear at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.03,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Kouki! Stand together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.03,0:00:16.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK~!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:17.99,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.99,0:00:19.91,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{Oh.}Uhh...{Doesn't sound like an actual word, sounds more like he's confused about getting attention from a girl.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:22.87,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:29.56,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Now, let's get one with just you and Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:32.40,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,{No you can't!}Don't think like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.40,0:00:34.65,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Children grow up very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.65,0:00:36.59,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,How could you not leave one for commemoration?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.47,0:00:39.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:44.35,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san, your expression is too stiff!{表情 hyoujou=expression}{This sentence is just fine.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:46.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{Seriously!}Wha...?! Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:51.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:55.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't I told you many times not to run off on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:56.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:02:59.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're already a big sister, so be more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.81,0:03:01.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:03.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"Yes~", stop that already.{You can hear him making fun of her, needs to be represented in the subs}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:06.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can I buy this as a snack?{Our name's mentioned :D :D -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.62,0:03:09.21,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Snack!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:12.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It looks really tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:17.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't you eaten any cereal before?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.99,0:03:21.97,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Am I too old for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I could buy it if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.18,0:03:27.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But this is for eating during breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:30.40,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What? You can eat snacks during meal times?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:32.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait... how do I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:34.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like a snack,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:38.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but it can be taken as a proper meal, if you pour some milk on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:42.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Eat it for breakfast tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.91,0:03:45.57,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi will have some too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:47.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll pass.{I can forget it.  }{In brackets is original TL, the one shown is literal TL. Please change to something better. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.14,0:03:48.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't fill me up much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Put the cereal inside this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}OK.{added. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:58.96,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Daikichi is so useless. {下手heta = unskillful}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}My hands are very dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Just like an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.63,0:04:03.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:06.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Oh! MitoKoumon. {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitokomon}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:13.57,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi. There's some cherry blossoms, so let's go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.57,0:04:14.31,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:17.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:19.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Because it's getting warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:23.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's in full bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:28.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Since you're already an elementary school student,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:30.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,why not plant something as a form of commemoration?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:31.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Commemoration?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.70,0:04:34.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It means to keep the memory of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:39.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The tree and Rin will grow taller together every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.17,0:04:43.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have a tree of my own, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:45.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,At our place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's at my old home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:50.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A Golden Osmanthus was planted when I was born. {木犀 mokusei = Osmanthus}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:53.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A Silver Osmanthus was planted when Kazumi was born, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:55.64,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is the Golden Osmanthus the one that's very fragrant?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:56.93,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:04:59.06,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I've never heard of the Silver Osmanthus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:03.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the smell and flowers of the Silver Osmanthus are very ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:07.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So Kazumi was always yelling, "How come only Onii-chan's flowers smell good? It's not fair!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.11,0:05:09.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,After that, she'd pluck the flowers on my Golden Osmanthus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:11.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I suggested to swap with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:14.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But she said, "I don't want hand-me-downs!"{Doesn't want the one I had used before}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:18.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Strange? There's not a single fond memory at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:20.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Then why am I trying to do the same thing again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:25.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, if you want to plant something, it's best to plant those that can bloom beautiful flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:27.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Or bear fruits that can be eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:28.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want a Loquat! {枇杷biwa = Loquat}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Loquat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:33.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Loquat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.19,0:05:39.54,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Loquat seeds. I've kept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.19,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You want to plant seeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can eat Loquats any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:45.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That is, if they bloom properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:50.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Initially, I wanted to plant a sapling around the same height as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:52.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Loquat's no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:56.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The rate at which the tree grows is much slower compared to the Morning Glory or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:58.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was from that saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:05:59.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Peach and chestnut seeds take three years to bear fruit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:01.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Plums take eight years! {桃栗三年柿八年 momokuri sannen, kaki ha chinen = meaning is it often takes time to bear the fruit of one's actions }
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:03.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's Grandpa's kid for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.75,0:06:05.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,How about Loquats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:06.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:09.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But what happens if it takes ten years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:15.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You'll probably be obsessed with desserts by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:17.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even bear to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:19.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.85,0:06:23.49,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It'll take a very long time before we can eat, if we don't plant it sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:25.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:29.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is this deep enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:33.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, the shoot won't come out if it's too deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:43.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I was right to say that you're the old man's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:45.72,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't it be great if it can bloom faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:46.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.76,0:06:50.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you know what a Ninja is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:54.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Kouki-kun said he wants to be a Ninja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:59.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The ninjas have to jump over a tree called the Hemp everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:04.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As the tree grows taller, the ninja will be able to jump extremely high.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:06.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:08.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should practise with the Loquat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:10.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want to try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.80,0:07:14.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:18.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:19.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:24.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, how tall can Loquats grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.48,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can it reach the roof of our house?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:27.36,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:30.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But it should be around there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:40.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You should get inside already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:41.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Then, ten more times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:47.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Will it sprout tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:49.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's a bit too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:52.19,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Make sure you don't forget anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:53.56,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.42,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Our timetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:08:00.06,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The teacher told us to have someone at home take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:02.21,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Man, what a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:06.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't have things like this when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:07.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's really true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:10.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's even "please acknowledge" on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:16.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.90,0:08:18.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like a patrol car.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:20.13,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,An accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.13,0:08:21.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:25.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, help me hook the whistle on the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:37.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When a stranger tries to talk to you, blow this with all your might.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:38.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:41.50,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Also, regardless of whose house it is, run into it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:42.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:43.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,One more thing, a shop is fine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:44.67,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:56.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! School!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.39,0:08:58.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry and wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:01.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.21,0:09:02.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Itadakimasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.52,0:09:04.56,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:06.80,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You have to add some milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:09.53,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I just eat it like this a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:10.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right, if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:18.25,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Pet dogs eat these, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:21.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's dog food; specially made just for dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:22.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:24.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It is so!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:27.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,People can't eat things that dogs eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.52,0:09:30.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give that disappointed face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:35.68,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:37.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:39.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But the best is still the Onigiri. {Riceballs}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:41.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The Onigiri sure is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:43.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.55,0:09:44.31,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.23,0:09:49.99,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.14,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:54.19,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki couldn't wait any longer, and ran off on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.19,0:09:58.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine. It's all right if he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:10:00.62,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.63,0:10:00.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:00.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.34,0:10:06.58,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:09.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, you have burrs all over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:12.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which monster-road did you take to get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:14.46,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.46,0:10:16.97,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,And also, what's with your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:18.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Bring a comb here, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:20.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:26.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, there are scratches on your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:28.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That piece of stick you're holding,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:31.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you were dragging it against the walls of others on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:33.08,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you a psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:35.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You can tell from one look, since it's so obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.41,0:10:38.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi must have done it in the past, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.65,0:10:40.48,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you hurry up and get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:42.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:44.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that stare of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.92,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:52.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:53.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:56.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:05.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun! You can't blow the whistle as and when you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:09.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:11.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you blowing that much for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:14.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No one will save you if you really get into trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:17.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:18.90,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.86,0:11:21.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, you two should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:24.32,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,We're going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:29.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:30.64,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.85,0:11:42.63,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.63,0:11:44.35,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:46.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We should go straight to school.{Heavily modified}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:49.66,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,We will, it's a shortcut.{Heavily modified}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.28,0:11:53.35,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,A real ninja...{\alpha&FFFFFF&} walks this sort of path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.35,0:11:56.61,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,A real ninja... walks this sort of path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...{boys are stupid!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.66,0:12:05.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's an curvy side road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:06.12,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.89,0:12:28.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, you're so slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:31.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't even a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:38.69,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You don't blow that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:13.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's really no helping that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:14.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:17.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, about that,{\alpha&FFFFFF&} boys are normally like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, about that, boys are normally like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.83,0:13:23.22,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:26.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But a ninja's practise is only jumping the Loquat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:27.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:38.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Erm, that Loquat is a memento of entering school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:39.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.38,0:13:44.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But your Golden Osmanthus is to commemorate your birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:45.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,so it's slightly different from mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.73,0:13:50.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there a Golden Osmanthus or something that belongs to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:53.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're really intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.27,0:13:57.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mother look like someone who would plant a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.23,0:14:01.79,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is it over at Grandpa's place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:03.03,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:04.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa probably would have planted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.59,0:14:07.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But you don't know whether there's any, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:08.82,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:13.74,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa is no longer around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:18.92,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't know, there's no way anyone else would.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:24.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I shouldn't have brought up the Golden Osmanthus matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.02,0:14:27.45,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! You're resting your elbows on the table again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:29.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:43.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:49.91,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I thought we wouldn't be meeting ever again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:53.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I should be the one telling you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:15:00.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This was taken during the entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:02.63,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:05.59,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What? Rin's tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:10.80,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yes! There is one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:15.56,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I mean... I think there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't even know if there is one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.88,0:15:21.44,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Souichi-san was the one who planted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:23.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:32.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I want to move that tree over to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of tree is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:36.32,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's a small tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:38.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I want to know what type of tree it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.65,0:15:40.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,As well as where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:46.04,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,The tree was still really small, and the branches also very thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:48.19,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.80,0:15:52.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I recall you're a manga artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:56.60,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't draw maps for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:15:58.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which direction is north?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:15:59.53,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,North?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.53,0:16:01.94,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,The sun rises from the west{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's the reverse! That song is reversed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.77,0:16:05.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Forget about the direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:08.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Can you draw the way from the front of the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.32,0:16:10.93,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.95,0:16:16.03,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll be leaving first, since I still have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:17.53,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your time. {She actually says "Gochisoumadeshita", please change appropriately. -sm}{I like it - AvidElite}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:20.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for taking time out of your busy schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:44.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Was it planted... my own tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:48.40,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Grandpa planted something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.40,0:16:50.28,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I have a good feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.28,0:16:56.23,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Even if there isn't one, it's fine if you just plant another tree to commemorate your entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.23,0:16:59.22,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Plant a six-year-old tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:00.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:02.72,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to take a look at Daikichi's tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:05.42,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.24,0:17:09.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.81,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's because it's already thirty years old, same as Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.81,0:17:14.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's tall, just like Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.51,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's called a Golden Osmanthus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.51,0:17:19.97,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. You know quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:21.26,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.26,0:17:23.69,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,This one over here is Kazumi's tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.69,0:17:24.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Silver Osmanthus?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.68,0:17:26.17,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:32.35,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember the huge tree in the backyard of Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:33.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.57,0:17:43.32,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That tree belongs to me; it's a Silver Osmanthus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.34,0:17:52.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? This tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:58.47,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1850)}Grandpa planted this for me when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.19,0:18:05.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Aunty and Kazumi Onee-chan are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.37,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.65,0:18:12.61,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I always compared my height with the tree's when I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:14.61,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I loved it a lot back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.82,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,So I planted the same tree for Kazumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:20.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see, that tree is a Silver Osmanthus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.78,0:18:23.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Did Daikichi also compare his height?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.27,0:18:24.49,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:35.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Much earlier than before that day we met...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:37.38,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That you're holding is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:40.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The same kind of leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.87,0:18:47.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,2000)}A six-year-old Golden Osmanthus, the same tree as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.05,0:18:53.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be completed like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:55.03,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.03,0:18:56.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:59.15,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.48,0:19:02.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even I can't jump over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.34,0:19:26.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Until half a year ago, I didn't even know that Rin existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.65,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:31.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! The train will leave soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.07,0:19:34.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:36.73,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll see both of you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.14,0:19:45.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But, even far before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:59.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You were already walking on the same path as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.27,0:21:40.11,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:42.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What happened!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.53,0:21:44.65,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:45.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.86,0:21:47.63,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,There's a weird uncle outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:49.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:49.98,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}No... The person is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Where is that uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:51.41,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Daikichi, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.41,0:21:54.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,HEY! Both of you listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.83,0:21:57.75,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's Matsui-san from next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.75,0:22:01.02,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say he's a weird uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:04.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.91,0:22:11.10,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I-am-sor-ry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:12.60,Default,Matsui,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.60,0:22:16.56,Default,Matsui,0000,0000,0000,,I must have frightened them by suddenly speaking to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:18.60,Default,Matsui,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:20.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, we should apologise instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.28,0:22:21.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was very rude of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:24.30,Default,Matsui,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, you two have a safe trip to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:25.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be going now~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.56,0:22:33.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.29,0:22:38.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You grabbed Rin and took her along when you escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.00,0:22:41.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What? Kouki-kun obviously made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.38,0:22:44.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm slightly at ease having Kouki with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.78,0:22:46.05,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Only slightly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.05,0:22:47.21,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, only slightly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.21,0:22:48.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're still an imp.{I love the use of the word "imp" for "chibi" - Editor Approved - AvidElite}{Same :D -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.29,0:22:50.51,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not an imp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:55.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to be late.{boys are stupid.}{Agreed. -sm}
